# BAWAAL onboarding stack (LOCKED)

The **landing / onboarding / OTP / legal / location-flag** flow is **production-final**. Do **not** modify, restyle, reorder, or “improve” it unless the user explicitly unlocks this rule.

## Locked files (do not edit)

- `RoleSelection.js` — LandingScreen / Enter the Arena form, demographics, role + sport pills, SEND OTP, OTP modal, Terms modal
- `OTPInput.js` — 4-digit boxes only; no auto-submit
- `OTPModal.js` — OTP shell; verify only via explicit SUBMIT / VERIFY
- `src/services/authOtp.js` — send/verify + dev phone bypass
- `src/utils/locationFlag.js` — location → country flag resolution
- `src/data/worldCountries.js` — worldwide country/territory flag registry
- `scripts/generateWorldCountries.js` — registry generator (regen only if user explicitly requests)

## Locked product surface

- Borderless black-and-white form; hairline underlines only (no heavy input boxes / white CTA blocks)
- Logos: `assets/BAWAAL_white_full.png` (header), `assets/BAWAAL_white_icon.png` (OTP)
- Field order: Handle → Real Name → **Gender + Age (side-by-side)** → Email → Mobile → Location → Role → Sport Interest
- Gender pills: Male / Female / Other; Age numeric — 50/50 row immediately under Real Name
- Sport Interest: single-line **horizontal** scrollable pills from locked `BAWAAL_SPORTS` (see `bawaal-sport-taxonomy-locked.mdc`)
- Location flag auto-resolves and persists via registration payload + `applyRegisteredProfile`
- Legal modal includes Medical/Psychiatric + General Platform disclaimers
- No Country/Language header on the landing form

## OTP contract (LOCKED)

- Exactly **4** digit boxes (`OTP_LENGTH = 4`) with dark navy fill `#0A192F`
- **Manual SUBMIT only** — never auto-verify on 4th digit or digit `onChange`
- Dev bypass (`src/services/authOtp.js`): phone `+917993992315` + OTP `1234` grants session immediately (no Supabase SMS); other phones use `verifyOtp`

## App wiring

- Entry continues to mount `RoleSelection` from `App.js`. Do not replace with a new LandingScreen or parallel onboarding UI.
- Do not strip `flag` / `country` / `location` / `gender` / `age` from the registration session payload.
- LOG OUT from Profile gateway / Passport must `supabase.auth.signOut()` and return to Entry (see `bawaal-passport-locked.mdc`).

## Allowed work elsewhere

- Build new screens, feeds, battles, camera, passport, etc. **outside** this stack.
- Critical crash/security fixes that must touch these files: ask the user first and keep the locked visual/UX contract intact.
